WEBVTT

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:34.306
Gràcies, pau i que Déu us guardi.

00:06:34.312 --> 00:06:39.944
(Aplaudiments)

00:06:39.944 --> 00:06:42.715
Gràcies. (Aplaudiments)

00:06:42.715 --> 00:06:46.015
Pat Mitchell: Heu sentit a la Maya parlar

00:06:46.015 --> 00:06:48.838
dels pares increïbles que es troben al darrera

00:06:48.838 --> 00:06:51.055
d'aquesta dona impressionant. On estan?

00:06:51.055 --> 00:06:54.053
Si us plau, Sr. i Sra. Penn. Podrien...? Ah!

00:06:54.053 --> 00:06:57.807
(Aplaudiments)